{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Orbit Tasks 是一款以快速捕捉與清晰規劃為核心的任務管理 App，適合需要整理工作與生活待辦事項、安排今日重點的使用者。此 App 原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>，方便你以更少干擾掌握每日任務。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-22.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>快速捕捉與規劃任務</h2>\n<p>Orbit Tasks 以收件匣優先方式讓使用者快速新增任務，再透過今日與規劃檢視安排先後次序。你可利用專案、領域與標籤整理生活，並加入筆記、優先級、時間或精力提示及估算。需要時可設定提醒，亦可為任何任務附加相片與檔案，配合強大搜尋與淺色、深色主題、強調色及文字大小選項，保持清晰專注。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-20-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-21-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-22-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-23-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-24-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-25-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Orbit Tasks</li><li>應用類別：Productivity</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/orbit-tasks/id6757943600?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T00:47:43.729529+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":312,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-01T21:02:38+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T11:58:56.473989+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T00:41:45.592943+00:00","content_hash":"628784fed10942cd40ad9352394157026210d9dde2b19402caf32c576faa4665","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}